{"content":"Implemented the fix for repositories containing `.*` ignore patterns.\n\n### Changes\n- Prevented `directoryLister.shouldIgnore` from applying ignore rules to the traversal root.\n- Applied the same root protection to `FastGlobWalker.ShouldSkip`, avoiding equivalent failures in fallback glob traversal.\n- Added regression tests confirming:\n  - Non-hidden files and nested files remain discoverable with `.*` in `.gitignore`.\n  - Hidden files and `.gitignore` remain excluded.\n  - Both directory listing/file completion and glob traversal behave correctly.\n\n### Verification\nAttempted `go test ./internal/fsext` and a formatting check. The environment lacks the `gofmt` executable, causing the parallel verification run to fail before the Go tests started; therefore, automated tests could not be completed. The modified Go code was manually checked for standard formatting and consistency.","type":"text"}
